{
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.ancient": "That armor of yours is fascinating! I'll let you take double if you let me have it!",
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.next": "Reply",
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.char": "Um... I'd prefer to keep it.",
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.ancient": "Take a look at these beauties! The armor offer still stands!!",
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.ancient": "I'm starting to get curious what you look like under all that metal...",
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.next": "Reply",
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.char": "...",
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "DARV.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.ancient": "Fine, fine, keep your secrets! I'll find a matching suit like yours one day!",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.ancient": "[sine]..what... do you...\n..come here... for...?[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.next": "Talk",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.character": "I have my own reasons.",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]..mercenary... you climb... again....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.ancient": "[sine]..you are... strong...\nbut not....strong.. enough....[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.next": "Answer",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.char": "I... have to keep trying. My will won't falter.",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.ancient": "[sine]....how... amusing...take this...[/sine]",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.ancient": "Hiding your beauty underneath all that armor, are you?\nThere's no need to hide yourself around me.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.next": "Answer",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.char": "Huh...? It's... nothing like that...",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-2.ancient": "Oh, I can tell you're a cute one, alright.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.ancient": "Even a mercenary like you could always use a gift, no?",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.ancient": "How about we get you prettied up? That armor isn't doing you any wonders.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.next": "Answer",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.char": "I'm just used to keeping it on.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.ancient": "Is that so...? I'm sure I can figure something out for you, even with that armor on.",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.ancient": "A demon!! Like Vakuu?! Dangerous!!",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.next": "Answer",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.char": "I'm not looking to fight.",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-2.ancient": "No fighting? Wow! Nice demon!! I like you!",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.ancient": "Nice demon!! Look at what I have! I will help you!!",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.ancient": "You have no color. Why no [rainbow freq=0.3 sat=0.8 val=1]colors[/rainbow]?! Not shiny at all!",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.next": "Answer",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.ancient": "No colors? I've never thought about that...",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "OROBAS.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.ancient": "I will give you color!! You need more color!! Here here here!",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.char": "Excuse me...?",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.ancient": "[thinky_dots]Your body is hurting...\nI will help relieve the weight on you...[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]Why do you fight so hard?\nRest with me...[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots][red]Father[/red] could help you...[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.next": "Refuse",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.char": "I already have all the help I need.",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "PAEL.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]If you insist...\nTake this... I'm going to sleep...[/thinky_dots]",
  "TANX.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.ancient": "THAT HAMMER! IT'S A MIGHTY WEAPON! I WILL GIVE YOU ANOTHER!",
  "TANX.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.ancient": "ARMORED WARRIOR! YOU ARE MIGHTY! I WANT TO FIGHT!",
  "TANX.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.ancient": "FIGHT ME, MUDROCK!!",
  "TANX.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.next": "Fight",
  "TANX.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.char": "[i][font_size=22]Mudrock half-heartedly fights with Tanx.[/font_size][/i]",
  "TANX.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "TANX.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.ancient": "YOU NEED TO FIGHT HARDER!! I KNOW YOU CAN!! TAKE WEAPON SO YOU CAN PREPARE!",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.ancient": "Hm? A newcomer? Come, come, I don't bite, dear!",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.next": "Respond",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.char": "Hello there... you're... burning?",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-2.ancient": "Oh, how polite! I burn hot for sweet things like you!",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.ancient": "There you are, sweetie! You're always welcome here!",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.ancient": "You're back again? You're not pushing yourself too hard, are you?",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.next": "Reply",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.char": "Fighting is most of what I know.",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.ancient": "Hmm... I don't like the [jitter]sound[/jitter] of that. Let me take care of you!",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.ancient": "Another demon? I can tell you're young.\nDon't you think we should work together?",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0.next": "Refuse",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.char": "I won't be led astray again.",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-2.ancient": "Don't be like that. My deals are in both of our interests...",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.ancient": "Still don't trust me? Maybe you'll change your mind after this.",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.ancient": "What is your goal here, little demon?",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0.next": "Remain Quiet",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.char": "...",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.ancient": "Not going to talk to me? That won't make you feel any better.",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2.next": "Reply",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-3.char": "I... don't need to tell you that.",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-3.next": "Continue",
  "VAKUU.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-3.ancient": "You can't refuse me forever. How about another... [jitter]little gift[/jitter]?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0r.char": "You are the source of all this? Why...?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1r.ancient": "Hm...?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-1r.next": "Respond",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-2r.char": "The soil will judge you!",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.char": "Don't think I'll go down without a fight.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-1r.ancient": "Resilient, but it's still not enough.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-1r.next": "Attack",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-2r.char": "Arise, great boulder!",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0r.char": "My will... will not falter.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1r.ancient": "You should learn to give up.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-1r.next": "Respond",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-2r.char": "I will face you, no matter what!",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.ARKNIGHTSMUDROCK-ARKNIGHTS_MUDROCK.2-attack": "Both"
}